<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs mostly steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs mostly steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were mostly steady. Demand very light with most buyers out of the market. Top $53.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-2 230-260 lbs. 51.50-53.00</p>
<p>US 2-3 230-260 lbs. 50.50-52.00</p>
<p>Sows: Steady to 1.00 higher. Top 53.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs. 40.00-44.00</p>
<p>	 450-500 lbs. 44.00-47.00</p>
<p>	 500-600 lbs. 49.00-50.00</p>
<p>few over   600 lbs. 50.00-52.00, few 53.00.</p>
</text>
